// Which bucket a name belongs in -- not a hash. It was called str_hash, which
// was both too vague (it names the mechanism, not the answer) and a claim on a
// name idstd defines properly; the collision was the rule doing its job. The
// bucket count, idx_n, is a constant in compiler/parse/conf.id.
name_bucket(string s) {
  int hv = 0;
  hv = hash_loop(s, 0, hv);
  int ret_i = hv % (import idx_n);
} return int ret_i;
